// flesh-pit loop patch. bpm 60: trigger(n) fires n per second. Loop length is set in sounds.json; every rate here divides it.
// id: amb_heart_b -- deeper: slower and heavier heart, 0.625 Hz (5 beats per 8 s). Mono sub.
hb = trigger(0.625)
lub = sine(54) * ar(hb, 0.05, 0.36) * 0.4
dub = lub |> delay(@, 0.36, 0.0, 1.0, 0.6)
out(dub |> hp(@, 45))
